      "notes": "The same feels and settings as 0.1.0, now also on macOS.\n\n- Runs with Valheim's Mac version from Steam and reads its log in `~/Library/Logs/IronGate/Valheim`. On a Mac the controller's haptics come over Bluetooth.\n- Recordings leave out your Mac user folder (`/Users/<name>`), as they do on Windows and Linux.\n- Needs Bururu with mod API 0.12.",
